  "title": "Dandelion Blossom Muffins with Chocolate Chips",
  "description": "Did you know you dandelion blossoms are edible? Don&#39;t just toss the prolific weed onto the compost - you can use them in these delicious chocolate chip muffins.",
  "authors": [
